# era-clinic module map

Architecture: [doc/ARCHITECTURE.md](../../doc/ARCHITECTURE.md) · ADR: [clinic-product-lines-and-presets.md](../../../docs/adr/clinic-product-lines-and-presets.md)

## Ops (preset `outpatient`)

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/` | — |
| `/appointments` | `/api/appointments` |
| `/patients` | `/api/patients` — register + list (sex, age in columns) |
| `/patients/[id]` | `/api/patients/[id]` PATCH; clinical demographics (sex, DOB→age, blood, emergency contact); contraindications; now/next + pending labs; results/plan previews + history/plan modals (`?panel=history|plan`) |
| `/api/mdm/person-lookup` | POST — MDM resolve prefill (session) |
| `/api/mdm/person-identifiers` | GET — identifier types for linked `globalPersonId` |
| `/api/mdm/person-merge` | POST — foreigner → citizen merge |
| `/scheduling` | `/api/scheduling/slots` |
| `/lab-orders` | `/api/lab-orders`, `/api/diagnostic-catalog` (picker + favorites sort) |
| `/reception/queue` | `/api/queue/*` |
| `/doctor`, `/nurse`, `/cashier` | role-guarded; `/cashier` disabled when `deferWalkInToHub` |
| `/executive` | `/api/executive/summary?date=&practitionerId=` (client `ExecutiveDashboard`; OrgOwner) |

## Preset `sanatorium_clinical`

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/sanatorium` | `/api/sanatorium/episodes`, `POST ?action=complete-checkup`, walk-in POST |
| `/nurse` | `POST /api/nurse/qr-scan`, `GET /api/nurse/overdue`; `POST /api/procedures/[id]/check-in\|complete\|no-show` |
| `/sanatorium/resources` | `GET …/calendar` matrix; `GET …/available-slots`; reception DnD / move / cancel |

## Preset `inpatient_day`

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/inpatient` | `/api/inpatient`, `/api/inpatient/admissions` |

## SatAdmin (`CLINIC_ADMIN` / `BUSINESS_OWNER` / platform super-admin)

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/admin/master-data` | `/api/admin/practitioners` (**403 POST** when `cp_workforce`; ops PATCH specialty/slots); `GET /api/admin/workforce-policy`; rooms, resources, procedure-types; link → `/admin/wards`; hire → orchestrator `/workspace/workforce` |
| `/admin/wards` | `/api/admin/wards`, `/api/admin/wards/[id]`, `/api/admin/beds/[id]` (modal CRUD) |
| `/admin/catalog` | `/api/admin/catalog`, `/api/catalog/sync` |
| `/admin/catalog-favorites` | `/api/admin/catalog-favorites` — favorite modalities/categories (`first` \| `only`) |
| `/admin/templates` | `/api/admin/clinical-templates`, program-templates (+ PATCH `[id]`) — seed pack: `prisma/seed-data/diagnostic-lab-catalog.json` ([DIAGNOSTIC_AND_LAB_CATALOG](../../doc/DIAGNOSTIC_AND_LAB_CATALOG.md)) |
| `/admin/procedure-rules` | `/api/admin/procedure-rules`, procedure-compatibility-rules (+ PATCH `[id]`) |
| `/admin/settings` | `/api/admin/settings` (name + **enabledPresets**) |
| `/admin/audit` | `/api/audit` |
| `/admin/lis-profiles` | `/api/admin/lis-profiles` |

## Integration

| Route | Auth |
|-------|------|
| `/api/integration/hotel-lifecycle` | bridge secret |
| `/api/integration/staff-provision` | bridge secret |
| `/api/integration/settlement-confirmed` | bridge secret — hotel Front Cash paid callback |
| `/api/billing/context` | session — `deferWalkInToHub` for cashier gate |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/reschedule` | session **RECEPTION** (+ admin) — matrix slot move (`resourceId` optional) |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/cancel` | session **RECEPTION** |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/check-in` | session NURSE — guest QR (or doctor/admin override+reason); grace window |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/no-show` | session NURSE |
| `/api/procedures/[id]/complete` | session NURSE — only from `CHECKED_IN` |
| `/api/nurse/qr-scan` | session NURSE — verifyGuestQrToken; returns `qrToken` for check-in |
| `/api/sanatorium/resources/available-slots` | session RECEPTION — free inventory (exhausted omitted) |
| `/api/capacity/summary` | bridge secret — GET remaining%/risk; POST evaluate+publish `CAPACITY_CHANGED` |

